Task 5: Find students whose overall marks are 75 or more



db.students.find({
    marks: { $gte: 75 }
})
```

**Output:**

```text
Arun    - 78
Chitra  - 91
Eswar   - 84
```

Task 6: Find students belonging to either CSE or IT department

**Command:**
db.students.find({
    dept: { $in: ["CSE", "IT"] }
})


**Output:**

```text
Arun    - CSE
Bala    - IT
Chitra  - CSE
Eswar   - IT
Farah   - CSE
```
task 7: Find students who scored more than 80 in DBMS

**Command:**

```javascript
db.students.find({
    scores: {
        $elemMatch: {
            subject: "DBMS",
            mark: { $gt: 80 }
        }
    }
})
```

**Output:**

```text
Arun    - DBMS: 85
Chitra  - DBMS: 95
Eswar   - DBMS: 88
```

Task 8: Display the top 3 students according to their marks

**Command:**

```javascript
db.students.find(
    {},
    {
        _id: 0,
        name: 1,
        marks: 1
    }
).sort({ marks: -1 }).limit(3)
```

**Output:**

```javascript
[
    { name: "Chitra", marks: 91 },
    { name: "Eswar", marks: 84 },
    { name: "Arun", marks: 78 }
]
```




